; pg — a Postgres client over the frontend/backend protocol version 3:
; the startup, SCRAM-SHA-256 authentication
; with the tls package's hashes, prepared statements through the extended
; query protocol with text parameters and text results, and a pool of
; connections per scheduler thread. The modules, in dependency order: the
; message buffer, SCRAM, the connection, the pool.
;
; A connection is a TcpStream like any other, so a query parks its task on
; the runtime's evented I/O and the scheduler runs other requests meanwhile.

package scaly 0.1.0
package tls 0.1.0

define pg
{
    module Buf
    module Scram
    module Conn
    module Pool
}
